        "created_at": "2020-12-23T23:22:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Maybe I should clarify my question.</p>\n<p>For the guided method, whatever the outcome of your rolls:&nbsp;it will always be limited by the size of the dice.&nbsp;For example,&nbsp;if you chose&nbsp;Armored Suit as your source, you can never roll an archetype higher than 16.</p>\n<p>Now for the constructed method, can you freely pick any archetype, or should you also pick an archetype no higher than 16?</p>\n<p>In more general Terms; the&nbsp;rules say to 'simply choose whichever option fits best' - but would you say this means to&nbsp;choose from the options of the dice rolls, or choose completely free?&nbsp;</p>\n<p>I hope this makes more sense...</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
