        "created_at": "2020-12-23T23:33:07.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>If you're doing Constructed pick whatever makes sense to you for Archetype. &nbsp; If that means you end up using Divided or Modular it means you need to decide on your other Archetype to go with it. &nbsp; You are not limited by what you could roll for dice in Constructed.&nbsp;</p>",
